# Two mutations of E8's sticky logic survive tb/tb_fma_diff.v. They are not
# gaps in that test -- they are semantically equivalent to the original, and
# these two miters prove it. Keep them: without this, a future mutation run
# reports two survivors and looks like a hole.
read_verilog syn/gt2n/prove_sticky_benign.v
hierarchy -top sticky_equiv
proc; opt -full; flatten; opt -full
sat -verify -prove diff 1'b0 sticky_equiv
design -reset
read_verilog syn/gt2n/prove_sticky_benign.v
hierarchy -top clamp_equiv
proc; opt -full; flatten; opt -full
sat -verify -prove diff 1'b0 clamp_equiv
